<title>FRANCE: Bertrand Faure 1996 sales up 10.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bertrand Faure 1996 sales up 10.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					13,871.3  up   10.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Bertrand Faure said its sales were up 11.9 percent on a constant structure basis.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
